{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19138","headline":"广宣上人寄在蜀与韦令公唱和诗卷因以令公手扎荅诗示之 · 刘禹锡","name":"广宣上人寄在蜀与韦令公唱和诗卷因以令公手扎荅诗示之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧云佳句久传芳，曾向成都住草堂。\n振锡常过长者宅，披衣犹带令公香。\n一时风景添诗思，八部人天入道塲。\n吾家本自有柴桑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}